Z||000003||WisconsinGT||02-08-2000||11:02 PM||||Jetro,<P>I hate to say it, ( I was hoping we could meet) but go for the warm weather. About 6 years ago, I moved to Dallas from WI. My wife and I moved there in the middle of a bloody cold winter here in WI. Man did I love the weather in Texas. It was great. If the right job came along I would be back down there in a sec. I realize that you have family and friends here, but Southwest airlines always has great deals on round trip flights.<BR>The things to look forward to in Dallas are...Fake breast, Snobby people, Topless bars everywhere, I think no state tax, Homes for dirt cheep, (They hire illegal immigrants and pay them close to nothing) The Macaroni Grill and much more.  ||||reg||1
